  "about_items": [
    {
      "n": "#382·01",
      "text": "The outer layer is a belted coat in black, crafted from soft brushed fabric that drapes elegantly. It features an oversized shawl collar and deep pockets, with the belt tied to define the silhouette while maintaining a relaxed feel."
    },
    {
      "n": "#71·33",
      "text": "This structured dress is entirely black and cut for a tailored fit. Its clean lines and classic shape offer a sophisticated base that works well under the coat, keeping you sleek through the evening."
    },
    {
      "n": "#439·03",
      "text": "The bag is a dark brown leather piece with a flap front, secured by a distinctive silver clasp and featuring adjustable straps for versatile wear."
    },
    {
      "n": "#61·03",
      "text": "These ankle boots are made of black suede with lace-up detailing and a low block heel. They offer sturdy support and a subtle 'W' logo detail on the toe cap, blending comfort with a touch of design."
    }
  ],
  "text": "You’re wearing a belted coat in black over a tailored dress that’s also black—both pieces are dark but textured differently, so they read as layered rather than flat. The coat’s soft brushed finish feels welcoming for autumn air, and its loose shape gives room to dance without feeling heavy. A brown leather bag with silver hardware brings warmth and a bit of contrast at the hip, while black suede boots ground the look with quiet polish. This outfit draws attention upward by leaving the middle relaxed and lets your eyes move up from your shoes all the way to your face. It works as an evening wear choice that balances ease with confidence for a club or celebratory dinner.",
  "how_to_wear": [
    "Tie the coat’s belt at the natural waist to define the torso without clinging, and let the dress fall freely underneath—this keeps the midsection airy while keeping your hips and shoulders aligned vertically.",
    "Carry the dark brown bag on the shoulder with one strap lengthened so it rests lightly across the hip; that position anchors the outfit and gives you hands free for a dance or a toast."
  ],
